  "rule": "A human_session caller has no grant and no delegation head. delegation_ref is null, and no parameter that names a delegation as the caller's own authority may be present. The register of delegation reference parameters says which parameter is which, per schema and caller kind: a delegation named as the operation's target \u2014 the grant a revocation revokes, the parent a redelegation narrows \u2014 is not a delegation the caller holds, so a human session may name it. No grant is fabricated, defaulted, or synthesized to satisfy a shared schema. The entitlement-backed P2/P3 case is covered by fence_authority_exactly_one."
